From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dominik Krivohlavek <github@xkrivo.net>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 19:20:57 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 08/31] fix(midea): handle J15 operation mode 5 and update
 mopMode

The firmware accepts operation mode 5 (AiClean) as well as 0-3. When the
app selected it the driver logged an unknown mopMode and showed no mode.
Read 5 as vacuum and mop, which is what the firmware coerces it to. It
is not offered as a preset.

Mode 6 is the firmware's customized clean (per-room settings) and is
deliberately left unknown.

Also fix the optimistic update after setting a mode in
MideaOperationModeControlCapabilityV2, which wrote the new value to
station_work_status (the dock status) instead of mopMode.

Based on static analysis of SetSweepMode; untested on the robot.

diff --git a/backend/lib/robots/midea/MideaValetudoRobot.js b/backend/lib/robots/midea/MideaValetudoRobot.js
index e527bd77..98c10cb2 100644
--- a/backend/lib/robots/midea/MideaValetudoRobot.js
+++ b/backend/lib/robots/midea/MideaValetudoRobot.js
@@ -297,8 +297,9 @@ class MideaValetudoRobot extends ValetudoRobot {
         }
 
         if (data.mopMode !== undefined) { // Mop mode 0 = vacuum & mop. Needs explicit check for !== undefined
+            const operationModeValue = MideaValetudoRobot.OPERATION_MODE_READ_ALIASES[data.mopMode] ?? data.mopMode;
             let matchingOperationMode = Object.keys(MideaValetudoRobot.OPERATION_MODES).find(key => {
-                return MideaValetudoRobot.OPERATION_MODES[key] === data.mopMode;
+                return MideaValetudoRobot.OPERATION_MODES[key] === operationModeValue;
             });
 
             if (matchingOperationMode) {
@@ -1385,6 +1386,11 @@ MideaValetudoRobot.OPERATION_MODES = Object.freeze({
     [stateAttrs.PresetSelectionStateAttribute.MODE.VACUUM_THEN_MOP]: 3,
 });
 
+// Modes the app can set that the firmware accepts, but which are not offered as presets
+MideaValetudoRobot.OPERATION_MODE_READ_ALIASES = Object.freeze({
+    5: 0, // AiClean, which the firmware turns into vacuum and mop
+});
+
 MideaValetudoRobot.WATER_GRADES = Object.freeze({
     [stateAttrs.PresetSelectionStateAttribute.INTENSITY.LOW]: 1,
     [stateAttrs.PresetSelectionStateAttribute.INTENSITY.MEDIUM]: 2,
